[13.984, "o", "** Please be patient while the chart is being deployed **\r\n"]
[13.984, "o", "NGINX can be accessed through the following DNS name from within your cluster:\r\n"]
[13.984, "o", "    pk3s-nginx.pk3s-nginx.svc.cluster.local (port 80)\r\n"]
[13.984, "o", "To access NGINX from outside the cluster, follow the steps below:\r\n"]
[13.984, "o", "1. Get the NGINX URL by running these commands:\r\n"]
[13.984, "o", "    export SERVICE_PORT=$(kubectl get --namespace pk3s-nginx -o jsonpath=\"{.spec.ports[0].port}\" services pk3s-nginx)\r\n"]
[13.984, "o", "    kubectl port-forward --namespace pk3s-nginx svc/pk3s-nginx ${SERVICE_PORT}:${SERVICE_PORT} &\r\n"]
[13.984, "o", "    echo \"http://127.0.0.1:${SERVICE_PORT}\"\r\n"]
